    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπνο-δότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>giver of sleep,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀτοβεῖ δόναξ . . ὑπνοδόταν νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					575
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.):—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπνο-δότειρα</span></b> , <i>she that gives sleep,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				175
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δοτείρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					312.1
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>):—a form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπνοδῶτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>
			[with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span>], occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				57.8
			</span></i>.</div>
